'''Slasher''' is a [[Godly Weapons|godly]] knife that is obtainable by unboxing it from [[Knife Box 4]] or through trading.  

== Appearance ==
Its blade is black in color and curved with sharp edges. Engraved in the blade are red beams and specs. The guard is black with three red specs, and the handle is also black with bright red beams. Attached to the bottom of the handle is the pointed red pommel.

== Trivia ==
* Its model derives from the Roblox gear [https://www.roblox.com/catalog/287424278/Orinthian-Electroslasher Orinthian Electroslasher], purchasable from the avatar shop for 500 Robux. However, it was retextured by [[Thexz]], altering it from a bright blue color to a red color.
* It partners with the [[Godly Weapons|godly]] gun [[Laser (Godly)|Laser]], making the [[Murder Mystery 2 Wiki:Wiki-Bot/Slasher Set|Slasher Set]].
*It has a [[Chroma Weapons|chroma]] counterpart under the name [[Chroma Slasher]], which can be found in the same box.
*When salvaged in the crafting station, it provides 35 godly [[shards]]. 

